## Proposed Changes

### 1. Test Infrastructure & Configuration

#### [NEW] [test-db-setup.ts](file:///Users/nguyenvominhhieu/Downloads/Seminar_nhom/Project/Backend/test/utils/test-db-setup.ts)
A reusable script that executes before running Integration & E2E tests to:
- Override the `DATABASE_URL` environment variables pointing to `*_test` databases.
- Run `prisma db push` for all 3 schemas (`users-service`, `scheduler-service`, `teamwork-service`) programmatically.
- Handle data clearing between tests safely (Truncating all tables except system schemas).

#### [NEW] [factories.ts](file:///Users/nguyenvominhhieu/Downloads/Seminar_nhom/Project/Backend/test/utils/factories.ts)
Factory pattern utilities to quickly seed mock users, groups, tasks, and messages with random/deterministic UUIDs.

---

### 2. Unit Testing (Co-located)

We will provide full unit tests for the core business services in each microservice module. All database connections, repositories, and caches are completely mocked.

#### [NEW] [users.service.spec.ts](file:///Users/nguyenvominhhieu/Downloads/Seminar_nhom/Project/Backend/src/users-service/users/users.service.spec.ts)
- Test suite for user profile CRUD operations, social login linking logic, and password hashing.
- Mocks: Prisma users-client.

#### [NEW] [scheduler.service.spec.ts](file:///Users/nguyenvominhhieu/Downloads/Seminar_nhom/Project/Backend/src/scheduler-service/scheduler/scheduler.service.spec.ts)
- Test suite for personal category, subject, and task scheduling.
- Mocks: Prisma scheduler-client, microservice notifications client.

#### [NEW] [teamwork.service.spec.ts](file:///Users/nguyenvominhhieu/Downloads/Seminar_nhom/Project/Backend/src/teamwork-service/teamwork/teamwork.service.spec.ts)
- Test suite for teamwork group creation, task delegation, leader assessments, and member role validation.
- Mocks: Prisma teamwork-client, socket.io gateways.

---

### 3. Integration Testing (Co-located)

Integration tests will focus on testing the database persistence layer, transaction safety, constraints, and request input validation. They run against the local isolated test databases.

#### [NEW] [users.integration.spec.ts](file:///Users/nguyenvominhhieu/Downloads/Seminar_nhom/Project/Backend/src/users-service/users/users.integration.spec.ts)
- Integration between UserService, custom database hooks, and Redis/cache validation.

#### [NEW] [teamwork.integration.spec.ts](file:///Users/nguyenvominhhieu/Downloads/Seminar_nhom/Project/Backend/src/teamwork-service/teamwork/teamwork.integration.spec.ts)
- Integration of groups, members cascade deletes, and unique constraint validations.

---

### 4. End-to-End (E2E) Testing (Centralized)

Centralized E2E tests under `/test/e2e` that spawn full NestJS modules, use Supertest to execute complete API flows, and verify integration.

#### [NEW] [auth.e2e-spec.ts](file:///Users/nguyenvominhhieu/Downloads/Seminar_nhom/Project/Backend/test/e2e/auth.e2e-spec.ts)
- Registers a new user, logins to fetch JWT tokens, and verifies profile data retrieval through API Gateway.

#### [NEW] [task.e2e-spec.ts](file:///Users/nguyenvominhhieu/Downloads/Seminar_nhom/Project/Backend/test/e2e/task.e2e-spec.ts)
- Creates subject/category, schedules a task, checks it off, and validates notification generation.

#### [NEW] [teamwork.e2e-spec.ts](file:///Users/nguyenvominhhieu/Downloads/Seminar_nhom/Project/Backend/test/e2e/teamwork.e2e-spec.ts)
- Group creation, member invitation flow, leader task submission, and review comments.

#### [NEW] [discussion.e2e-spec.ts](file:///Users/nguyenvominhhieu/Downloads/Seminar_nhom/Project/Backend/test/e2e/discussion.e2e-spec.ts)
- Emulates Socket.io gateway connections to verify group real-time chats, mentions resolving, and sticker messages.

---

### 5. Script & Package Configuration

#### [MODIFY] [package.json](file:///Users/nguyenvominhhieu/Downloads/Seminar_nhom/Project/Backend/package.json)
Configure standardized scripts:
- `pnpm test:unit` -> Run unit tests co-located beside source code.
- `pnpm test:integration` -> Run integration tests utilizing isolated test database setup.
- `pnpm test:e2e` -> Run centralized E2E tests.
- `pnpm test:all` -> Executes all tests sequentially and compiles overall coverage metrics.

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `pnpm test:unit` to verify unit test correctness and coverage.
- Run `pnpm test:integration` to verify integration behaviors against PostgreSQL test databases.
- Run `pnpm test:e2e` to verify all end-to-end user journeys through the API Gateway, microservices, and websockets.
- Ensure all tests complete successfully with **100% stability and zero flaky executions**.
